4110 {\cf20 // Provides a multilane implementation of an atomic variable that supports add, sub, load,}\par
4111 {\cf20 // store. Instead of using a single atomic variable, this splits up into multiple ones,}\par
4112 {\cf20 // each sitting on a separate cache line. The goal is to provide a speedup when most}\par
