4115 {\cf20 // * Multiple atomics are used, so chance of congestion from the same atomic is reduced.}\par
4116 {\cf20 // * Each atomic sits on a separate cache line, so false sharing is reduced.}\par
4117 {\cf20 //}\par
4118 {\cf20 // The disadvantage is that there is a small overhead due to the use of TLS, and load/store}\par
4119 {\cf20 // is slower because all atomics have to be accessed.}\par
